From: daurosk <354202035+daurosk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:02:58 -0900
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] coop: a portable kit reads only its own nx2_switches.txt

Fritchii reads nx2_switches.txt beside the exe and then the one in
%APPDATA%\fritchii (v5.8; eden before). An OoT co-op kit is portable
(user\ beside lichii.exe) and must stay apart from the player's normal
install, so with a user\ folder only the kit's own file is read.
---
 src/yuzu/main.cpp | 19 ++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/yuzu/main.cpp b/src/yuzu/main.cpp
index fc4306f66b..aed6f86d85 100644
--- a/src/yuzu/main.cpp
+++ b/src/yuzu/main.cpp
@@ -210,9 +210,26 @@ static void LoadNx2Switches(const char* argv0) {
     for (const auto& [name, value] : BuiltinSwitches) {
         entries.emplace(name, value);
     }
-    if (const auto exe_dir = GetSwitchExeDirectory(argv0); !exe_dir.empty()) {
+    const auto exe_dir = GetSwitchExeDirectory(argv0);
+    if (!exe_dir.empty()) {
         ParseSwitchFile(exe_dir / "nx2_switches.txt", entries);
     }
+    // OoT co-op: a portable kit (user\ beside the exe) reads only its own switches, never the
+    // player's normal install's (%APPDATA%\fritchii or eden): the kit stays apart from it.
+    std::error_code portable_ec;
+    if (!exe_dir.empty() && std::filesystem::is_directory(exe_dir / PORTABLE_DIR, portable_ec)) {
+        for (const auto& [name, value] : entries) {
+            if (std::getenv(name.c_str()) != nullptr) {
+                continue;
+            }
+#ifdef _WIN32
+            _putenv_s(name.c_str(), value.c_str());
+#else
+            setenv(name.c_str(), value.c_str(), 1);
+#endif
+        }
+        return;
+    }
 #ifdef _WIN32
     const auto app_data = Common::FS::GetAppDataRoamingDirectory();
 #else
